fix: mergeAll OT convergence + mergeORSet void-return test contracts

- mergeAll in conflict.ts: sort all ops by (lamport, deviceId) before
  applying so concurrent inserts converge regardless of delivery order
  (was building ops asymmetrically — remote ops untransformed against local).
- tests/phase6/convergence-recovery.test.ts: bind mergeORSet assertions
  to in-place state (mergeORSet returns void, never the set), fix
  buildRespondingTransport push_ack to carry payload: {accepted,conflicts,serverLamport}
  per buildPushAck shape in protocol.ts:58, import ConflictInfo from types.ts.
